# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Why this file exists: prevents secrets, build artifacts and local machine
# noise from ever being committed to any of the 4 branches or main.
# The single most important line here is ".env" — that is what keeps every
# API key in API_KEYS.txt OUT of GitHub history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Dependency directories (reinstalled via `npm install`, never committed)
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
backend/node_modules/

# Environment files containing secrets (VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, OTX, Gemini keys)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
backend/.env
frontend/.env

# Build output
frontend/dist/
backend/dist/

# SQLite database (contains cached IoC lookup history — local dev data, not code)
backend/data/*.sqlite
backend/data/*.sqlite-journal
backend/data/*.sqlite-wal
backend/data/*.sqlite-shm

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
